  "solution": "**Given: **\n\nx : y = 2 : 1\n\n**Calculation:**\n\nx/y = 2/1\n\n⇒ x = 2y\n\nNow, (2x + 3y) ∶ (4x + 7y)\n\n⇒ (2 × 2y + 3y) : (4 × 2y + 7y)\n\n⇒ (4y + 3y) : (8y + 7y)\n\n⇒ 7y : 15y = 7 : 15\n\n**∴ The value is 7 : 15**",
